off-season irrigation wetting 40 % of the surface
     7.3       : AquaCrop Version
     0         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches BEFORE growing period
     0         : percentage (%) of ground surface covered by mulches AFTER growing period
    50         : effect (%) of mulches on reduction of soil evaporation
     0         : number of irrigation events BEFORE growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water BEFORE growing period (dS/m)
     1         : number of irrigation events AFTER growing period
     0.0       : quality of irrigation water AFTER growing period (dS/m)
    40         : percentage (%) of soil surface wetted by off-season irrigation

